# Example CARDLESS loop: post-merge follow-up. A human merges every batch PR into
# `main` (agents never do — .agents/workflow.md § Branching), so nothing runs the
# moment the merge happens. This loop picks it up afterwards: for each `Ready` card
# whose linked PR is MERGED into main → TMS back-write, locator scan + ledger sync,
# merge record. The card stays `Ready` — `Done` is the human's move.
# Rename to postmerge.env + postmerge.md to activate: ./factory/run.sh postmerge
AGENT="test-automation-lead"
CARDLESS=1
EXCLUSIVE=1                  # checks out a fresh branch for the ledger PR and commits
                               # in the TMS sibling clone — never beside a live session
QUERY=""            # unused in cardless mode (the prompt lists Ready cards itself)
POLL="1h"            # merge-to-merge-record latency; the control loop flags > 24h
MAX_TURNS=""        # optional cap, as everywhere
WORKDIR="/opt/work_dir/elitea-testing-public"   # the clone whose main it reads;
                               # the TMS clone is its sibling ../onetest-ai-tm-Elitea
